        "en": "Clients frequently commend Dr Ou and the clinic team for their welcoming manner, thorough guidance, and empathetic support. Pet owners note that the staff take time to discuss treatment options without rushing appointments. One reviewer expressed disappointment with their visit, but the vast majority praise the team for their genuine kindness and dedication during routine check-ups and urgent consultations."
