      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight how tenderly dogs and cats are handled during examinations, dental procedures, and palliative consultations. Several pet parents remark that anxious animals quickly settle down thanks to the calm approach of the veterinary nurses and clinicians. Families appreciate that pets facing difficult illnesses are kept comfortable and treated with dignity."
      }
    },
