      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and honest guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents appreciate that Dr Ou and the nursing team explain diagnostic tests, proposed therapies, and estimated fees in clear detail. Multiple owners note that questions are answered patiently, ensuring clients feel fully informed about their pet's home recovery plan. Reviewers value the open discussions regarding procedural steps and preventative care."
      }
    }
